WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.458
What if your life insurance could
help you live better?

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:06.250
At Manulife, we believe living longer 

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.375
should also mean living better every day.

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:12.291
That’s why
we created Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt;,

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:14.458
a program built to help Canadians

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:16.916
live longer, healthier, better lives

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:20.000
while gaining the protection
and peace of mind they deserve.

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:25.583
Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt; relentlessly innovates
by combining insurance coverage

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:28.875
with an easy-to-use app
that supports better health

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:33.041
through education, incentives,
and meaningful discounts.

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:36.250
Keeping members motivated
every step of the way.

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:39.125
Earn points for healthy habits,

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:43.125
both the ones you already have
and the ones you build.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.791
The more points you earn,
the more you benefit.

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:52.083
Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt; is available
on eligible term and permanent insurance products.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:56.541
For a small monthly fee,
Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality Plus&lt;/i&gt; offers

00:00:56.625 --> 00:01:00.041
extra rewards and tools
that support healthy habits.

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:03.583
Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt; is
more than insurance.

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:06.833
It’s your partner in health,
helping you stay motivated,

00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:08.208
build a healthier future

00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:11.250
and potentially save
on your premiums along the way.

00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:13.791
Ask your advisor about Vitality

00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:16.250
and how it can fit
with your Manulife coverage.

